============================================================================

Flags.doc :
For those people without a handy calculator or the inclination to add,
here's another version of the ever popular mud flags :)

 -- Elendil

============================================================================

ROOM FLAGS
==========


ROOM_DARK           1        Dark  
ROOM_DEATH          2        Death trap 
ROOM_NOMOB          4        MOBs not allowed 
ROOM_INDOORS        8        Indoors  
ROOM_PEACEFUL       16       Violence not allowed
ROOM_SOUNDPROOF     32       Shouts,ossip blocked
ROOM_NOTRACK        64       Track won'to through
ROOM_NOMAGIC        128      Magic not allowed 
ROOM_TUNNEL         256      room for only 1 pers
ROOM_PRIVATE        512      Can't teleport in 
ROOM_GODROOM        1024     LVL_GOD+ only allowed

DOOR FLAGS
==========

EX_ISDOOR           1        Exit is a door 
EX_CLOSED           2        The door is closed
EX_LOCKED           4        The door is locked
EX_PICKPROOF        8        Lock can't be picked


