MOB_AWARE           16       Mob can't be backstabbed 
MOB_AGGRESSIVE      32       Mob hits players in the room
MOB_STAY_ZONE       64       Mob shouldn't wander out of zone
MOB_WIMPY           128      Mob flees if severely injured
MOB_AGGR_EVIL       256      auto attack evil PC's 
MOB_AGGR_GOOD       512      auto attackood PC's 
MOB_AGGR_NEUTRAL    1024     auto attack neutral PC's 
